<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityOccurrence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "assessment performed"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityOccurrence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "procedure"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityOccurrence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "study task"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityOccurrence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Activity Occurrence"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityOccurrence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The universal performed-activity node (first-principles P5): blood draw, ECG, MRI, ePRO completion are all this class, specialized by biomedical-concept code — never by subclass."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ActivityTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The protocol-defined activity template: the procedure to perform at a visit. USDM-ingest-derivable from StudyDesign.activities[]. Carries the biomedical-concept code that determines what kind of data the activity collects. USDM: Activity." .
