<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Must declare prov:wasDerivedFrom its source so any result built on it is reproducible to source. Its ADaM structure (ADSL/BDS/OCCDS) is cr:datasetStructure — a value, not a subclass (ADR-0024 one-question gate)." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis Dataset (ADaM)" .
