<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An ADaM analysis dataset (e.g. ADSL, ADAE, ADEFF) — analysis-ready data derived from the native clinical facts, structured per a CDISC ADaM structure class." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Analysis Dataset"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDecision> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDecision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Makes the decision a first-class, evidenced node rather than a free-text cr:meetingOutcome. The decision is bitemporal: superseding a decision (e.g. a later reversal) is a new assertion, never a rewrite." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#AnalysisDecision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis Decision (gate)" .
