<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CAPA> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CAPA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Corrective And Preventive Action — the formal response to a deviation or finding (corrective: fix this occurrence; preventive: stop recurrence). Bitemporal + attested." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CAPA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CAPA" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CAPA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Temporal> .
