<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CDISC_CDASH> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CDISC standard defining the content of data collected on case report forms. Primary crosswalk target for cr:OperationalRecord field mapping." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CDISC_CDASH> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CDISC CDASH — Clinical Data Acquisition Standards Harmonization" .
