<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CDISC_SDTM> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#RegulatoryLaw> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CDISC_SDTM> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CDISC standard for organizing and formatting clinical trial data for regulatory submissions (FDA/PMDA)." .
