<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#RegulatoryLaw> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_11> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "US FDA regulation governing electronic records and electronic signatures in clinical data systems. Requires audit trails, access controls, and non-repudiable e-signatures." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_11> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "21 CFR Part 11 — Electronic Records and Signatures" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_11> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "21 CFR Part 11" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_11> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> "active" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_312> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#RegulatoryLaw> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_312> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "US FDA IND regulations. Governs the submission, conduct, and reporting obligations of IND-enabling and IND-active clinical trials in the US." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_312> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "21 CFR Part 312 — Investigational New Drug Application" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "21 CFR Part 312" .
