<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_50> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#RegulatoryLaw> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_50> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "US FDA informed consent regulations. Governs the process and documentation of consent from trial participants." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_50> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "21 CFR Part 50 — Protection of Human Subjects" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_50> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "21 CFR Part 50" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_50> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> "active" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_56> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#RegulatoryLaw> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_56> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "US FDA IRB regulations. Governs the composition, operations, and responsibilities of IRBs that review clinical trials." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CFR_21_Part_56> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "21 CFR Part 56 — Institutional Review Boards" .
