<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CSRSection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The sectionKind qualifier (efficacy-results | safety-results | synopsis | narrative | administrative) selects which sections must carry analysis traceability, without a parallel hierarchy." .
