<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CSRSection> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A section of a Clinical Study Report, keyed to its ICH E3 number (e.g. 11.4 Efficacy Results, 12.2 Adverse Events). A results section presents the TLFs and reports the results it draws its conclusions from." .
