<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#DataTransferAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grounded in the DTA MVP Information Model DTA entity and MVP Inventory §3 (Version, Version Date, Version Change Rationale). Not a Word/PDF artifact with fields — a fact graph." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#DataTransferAgreement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data Transfer Agreement" .
