<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#IntegratedSummary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The kind (safety vs efficacy) is cr:summaryKind, a value — not two classes (ADR-0024). Multi-study by construction: >=1 cr:integratesStudy, each referenced by IRI. Derives from the per-study ADaM datasets via prov:wasDerivedFrom, so the integrated number is reproducible to each study's source." .
