<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#MetricObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The bitemporal envelope is what answers the inspector's question 'why didn't the algorithm flag the March 1 event on March 3?' — because recordedAt shows the event had not yet arrived." .
