<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#MetricObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "KRI reading"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#MetricObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "centralized monitoring output"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#MetricObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A computed value of a monitored quality parameter at a point in time — the output of a centralized-monitoring run. Attributed (prov:wasAttributedTo) to the computing agent, typically a system agent; bitemporal, so 'what did the algorithm know on March 3' is a filter, not an excavation." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#MetricObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Metric Observation"@en .
