<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#OversightStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risk-based monitoring, interim monitoring visits, source data verification, deviation identification and classification, CAPA management, audit. Operator primary: CRA + Sponsor Quality." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#OversightStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Oversight" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ParticipantSchedule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ParticipantSchedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The schedule projected for a specific subject from a ScheduleTimeline once an anchor date (e.g. enrollment) is known. Bitemporal: re-projected when the governing protocol version changes." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#ParticipantSchedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Participant Schedule" .
