<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#PharmacovigilianceSpecialist> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Manages safety signal detection, expedited SAE reporting, safety line listings, and periodic safety reports (DSUR, PSUR). OOUX persona aliases: Pharmacovigilance, PV." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#PharmacovigilianceSpecialist> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pharmacovigilance Specialist" .
