<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RandomizationEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A promoted fact (first-principles P6): 'is randomized' is never a flag — it is this event, with its time, its authority (the system or the unblinded pharmacist), and its stratum." .
