<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One class, four scopes (ADR-0024 one-question gate: drug vs document reconciliation is a classification of the act, not a different kind of act). The IMP scope reconciles against the accountability-log projection (supply module) — arithmetic over events, not a spreadsheet." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reconciliation" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Temporal> .
