<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "device reconciliation"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "document reconciliation"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "drug reconciliation"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The act of confirming that a site's records balance at closeout — investigational product counts, device counts, essential documents, or open queries. The scope (what is being reconciled) is cr:reconciliationScope, a value." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reconciliation"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Reconciliation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "One act, four scopes (IMP/device/documents/queries) — the scope is a value, never four classes (ADR-0024)."@en .
