<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "PII containment: downstream clinical data NEVER references a Recruit (cr:forSubject ranges over cr:StudySubject only). The candidate's identifiable record stays inside the site boundary; conversion to a pseudonymous Participant happens only via the attested cr:Enrollment bridge. Retires the legacy undefined cr:Recruit used by pre-rich-shell examples." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Recruit" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Agent> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "candidate"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "prospective participant"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "referral"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A candidate considered for study participation, from first contact until conversion (enrollment) or exit. A site-boundary identity: PII-side, like hcls:Person." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recruit"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#Recruit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "PII-side, site-boundary identity — never referenced by downstream clinical data. Converts to Participant only via the attested Enrollment bridge."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top of the funnel. Carries its channel (cr:campaignChannel) and the study it recruits for." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Recruitment Campaign" .
