<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "patient finding"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "recruitment"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A planned outreach effort to find candidates for a study — advertising, referral programs, EHR cohort searches, community outreach." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentCampaign> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recruitment Campaign"@en .
