<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RecruitmentStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Candidate identification, screening, informed consent, eligibility assessment, enrollment, randomization. Operator primary: Site Coordinator + Investigator." .
