<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An assessment of risk to a CtQ factor. Carries the ICH Q9(R1) decomposition — cr:likelihood, cr:impact, cr:detectability — plus the rolled-up cr:riskLevel and optional cr:riskScore. Bitemporal: re-assessments supersede, never overwrite." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Assessment" .
