<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "RACT entry"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "risk review"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Risk Assessment"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A living document — updated as circumstances change; versions supersede bitemporally. Aggregates via cr:documentsAssessment." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Management Plan" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Constraint> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Versioned> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "RBQM plan"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "RMP"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "quality management plan"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The living document that records the trial's risk methodology and current risk posture: identified assessments, evaluation criteria, control strategies, monitoring approach, and review cadence." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskManagementPlan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Risk Management Plan"@en .
