<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#RiskReview> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "RBQM is a cycle, not a checklist: identification, evaluation, control, communication, review — and review feeds back into identification. The review is the entity that makes the cycle auditable." .
