<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SUSAR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Suspected Unexpected Serious Adverse Reaction — requires expedited regulatory reporting (7 days fatal/life-threatening, 15 days other). ADR-0024 known deviation: 'suspected' (causality) and 'unexpected' (vs. reference safety information) are judgments against criteria; refactors together with cr:SeriousAdverseEvent in the dedicated safety-module pass." .
