<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteActivationStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Study Startup Package readiness, Site Initiation Visit (SIV), training, delegation of authority, equipment qualification. Output: site activated and ready to enroll. (The stage; the green-light act itself is cr:SiteActivation.)" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteActivationStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Site Activation" .
