<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A promoted fact (P6): 'isClosed' is never a flag. Closure without its evidence (COV + reconciliations complete) is a Violation." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Site Closure" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Outcome> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Versioned> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "closure"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "site closed"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "site closeout"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The record that a site's participation in the study has ended — resting on the Close-Out Visit and the completed reconciliations." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteClosure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Site Closure"@en .
