<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A periodic KPI snapshot for a study site; bitemporal (top:observedAt = snapshot date, top:validFrom = reporting period start)." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Site Metrics" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Evidence> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#SiteMetrics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Versioned> .
