<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudyStartupPackage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The bundle of document artifacts a site receives on being awarded a study. Not a singular item — a set of typed artifacts; in practice fetched one-by-one from sponsor portals." .
