<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The pseudonymous in-study participant identity. Linked to an hcls:Person via the bitemporal cr:Enrollment act (the sensitive bridge); carries no PII. Preferred label 'Participant' per ADR-0024 (operator vocabulary, first-principles P2); the IRI stays cr:StudySubject for stability. The PII boundary is held by homonym routing, not the label: 'Participant' names this pseudonymous identity, never the identifiable hcls:Person." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Participant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Agent> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "study participant"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "study subject"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "subject"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "ResearchSubject"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "patient"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Participant"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "ADR-0024: 'Participant' is the preferred operator label for the pseudonymous in-study identity (IRI stays cr:StudySubject for stability). 'Patient' is routed but not promoted — industry drift toward 'patient' is noted; in clinical research the person is a participant, patient only in care contexts. The identifiable human is hcls:Person, never this class; the only bridge is the attested cr:Enrollment."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> <http://www.w3.org/2008/05/skos-xl#altLabel> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#xl-participant-patient> .
