<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#TableListingFigure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The tlfType qualifier (table | listing | figure) distinguishes the kind without a parallel hierarchy. A TLF that is not pre-specified is a post-hoc analysis — legitimate as exploratory, inadmissible when presented as pivotal." .
