<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#TableListingFigure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A pre-specified analysis output — a table, a listing, or a figure — built from an ADaM analysis dataset. The unit the CSR and the submission actually present. Must be reproducible to source (prov:wasDerivedFrom an AnalysisDataset) and grounded in the SAP that pre-specified it." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#TableListingFigure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Table, Listing or Figure"@en .
