<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorAlias> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorAlias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The exemplar of the whole thesis. Resolve once; the next sponsor with the same vendor term auto-resolves. Grounded in the info-model ENCOUNTER_MAPPING / Data-Provider-Visit fields — deliberately re-modeled." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorAlias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Vendor Alias" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorAlias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Evidence> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorAlias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A vendor's term (column name, visit label, unit string) captured ONLY as a resolution edge into the canonical corpus: cr:vendorTerm (the raw string) + cr:aliasResolvesTo (the canonical concept/encounter/unit) + cr:resolutionConfidence + cr:resolvedFrom provenance. Deliberately NOT a stored per-DTA row — the DTA group's ENCOUNTER_MAPPING re-modeled as resolution so the corpus compounds." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorConnectorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorConnectorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instances grounded in verified public documentation: Castor EDC (OAuth2 REST + CDISC ODM export), Veeva Vault CDMS/CDB (SDE CSV/SAS/XPT + incremental SFF), Medidata Rave (RWS + ODM + audit-ID incremental), Oracle Clinical One (ODM-XML extract, Snapshot/Transactional). See examples/dta-lab-safety/vendor-connectors.ttl." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorConnectorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Vendor Connector Profile" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorConnectorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#TransferProfile> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VendorConnectorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A TransferProfile pre-populated from a named vendor's documented data-export surface (API/format/terminology), so a sponsor onboarding that vendor starts from a catalog default rather than a blank DTA. The operational counterpart to the compounding alias corpus." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#VerifyCAPAEffectiveness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://top.scientix.ai/hcls/v1#Action> .
