<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#unboundRationale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#unboundRationale> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Additive" .
