<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/thesaurus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/thesaurus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Controlled-vocabulary + thesaurus layer for the CR domain (ADR-0024; first-principles P7 layers 1 and 4). Labels only — no classes or properties are defined here." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/thesaurus> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/tmf-onboarding> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Trial Master File onboarding: expected-essential artifact sets and the filed-set diff." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/tmf-onboarding> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "TMF — onboarding & completeness" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/tmf-onboarding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/tmf-reference> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "TMF artifact types aligned by name to the DIA TMF Reference Model (licensed; no text reproduced)." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/tmf-reference> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "TMF — artifact type reference" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/tmf-reference> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/visit-execution> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Actual visit conduct against the SoA: performed activities, missed visits, visit-level capture." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1/visit-execution> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "CR-core — visit execution" .
