<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#recordedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transaction time (append-only): when the system first knew this fact. Never rewritten. Complements top:observedAt / top:validFrom (valid time). PROV peer: prov:generatedAtTime carries the same instant when a generation activity is modeled."@en .
