<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#severityLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Operational impact of violation. Universal enum — INFORMATIONAL / MINOR / MAJOR / CRITICAL. Workflow extensions can refine."@en .
