<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#sourceContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The retrieved context passages (e.g. SPARQL results, vector-search snippets) injected into the prompt. Stored verbatim. See the PII scope note in this module's header." .
