<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Tightenable" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transaction time (append-only): when a later assertion superseded this one. A correction is a NEW assertion carrying its own recordedAt; this timestamp closes the old one and is never rewritten."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "superseded at"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Invariant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Domain intentionally open: rdfs:domain is an inference axiom, not a constraint — a domain of top:Versioned would retype every dated entity as Versioned and drag it under the versioning contract (the RDFS target cascade). The requirement side lives in SHACL: top:BitemporalShape demands validFrom on Versioned."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Start of the valid-time interval — when this version's state became true in the world. Distinct from top:observedAt (transaction time). Invariant per ADR-0019, like top:startTime/top:endTime. No PROV-O peer: PROV models system time, not valid-time-of-a-fact (declared absence, per ADR-0021)."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valid from"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Invariant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "End of the valid-time interval; open (absent) for the currently-valid version. Invariant per ADR-0019."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valid until"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
