<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Delta between expected and actual. Format depends on leaf specialization."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Outcome> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "variance"@en .
