<https://top.scientix.ai/v1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The universal foundation of The Ontology Project: one root (top:CommonEntity), eight Category-Level Objects, the Universal DNA (identifier / observedAt / status), the ADR-0021 bitemporal vocabulary, and the ADR-0019 extension-flavor contract. Domain reference graphs (e.g. TOP-CR) specialize this artifact and pin it by checksum." .
